-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.9 מורה לחינוך גופני
-- The additional clothing allowance of a physical-education teacher: who
-- gets it, when it is paid, the one-position cap and its yearly update.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.9 מורה לחינוך גופני`

DECLARE `PE clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the additional clothing allowance` HAS `amount paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `3.9.4 קצובת ביגוד`

@desc A physical-education teacher's year, as far as section 3.9.4 asks about it.
DECLARE `PE clothing year` HAS
    `teaches physical education`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `meets the criteria of the table`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc the teacher meets the payment criteria of the table section 3.9.4 refers to; an input (see below)
    `position fraction`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position the teacher holds (1 = one full position)
    `allowance for one position`        IS A NUMBER  @desc the additional clothing allowance for one full position this year; an input, updated yearly under section 3.9.4(b)

-- §3.9.4.1: a physical-education teacher is entitled to an additional
-- clothing allowance, to buy gym clothes.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p1
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the additional clothing allowance` y IF
    y's `teaches physical education`

-- §3.9.4.2: paid once a year with the regular clothing allowance, in June.
-- Time in school months (September = 1): June is the tenth.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p2
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `PE clothing action`
DECIDE `payment of the additional clothing allowance in June` y IS
    IF `paid the additional clothing allowance` y
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowance` a
               PROVIDED a AT LEAST `additional clothing allowance` y
         WITHIN `month number` June
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 3.9.4.2: the additional clothing allowance is paid with the regular one, in June"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §3.9.4 ¶3 introduces "a table summarising the payment criteria". The
-- corpus does not carry it: on the source page the words "להלן טבלה" are a
-- link to a separate PDF (table_13.pdf) that the corpus did not ingest. A
-- loss in the corpus, not a flaw of the text, so it is no finding here; the
-- criteria are an input (`meets the criteria of the table`) until the corpus
-- holds the table.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p3
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the table's criteria are met` y IF
    y's `meets the criteria of the table`

-- The allowance is paid to the teacher 1 entitles who meets the table's
-- criteria.
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid the additional clothing allowance` y IF
    `entitled to the additional clothing allowance` y AND `the table's criteria are met` y

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p4 A heading ("הערות", notes) over the two notes below.

-- Note (a): paid up to one position only — read as paid by the position
-- held, and never for more than one.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p5
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `additional clothing allowance` y IS
    IF `paid the additional clothing allowance` y
    THEN y's `allowance for one position` TIMES min (y's `position fraction`) 1
    ELSE 0

-- Note (b): updated once a year by the same rate as the clothing allowance
-- paid to all state employees and teachers; the rate is published by the
-- owners' circulars ("חוזרים לבעלויות"), so it is an input.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p6
GIVEN `last year's allowance` IS A NUMBER, `the general clothing allowance's update rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `this year's allowance for one position` `last year's allowance` `the general clothing allowance's update rate` IS
    `last year's allowance` TIMES (1 PLUS `the general clothing allowance's update rate`)

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p7 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p8 Source (אסמכתא): Director-General's circulars.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p9 Source (אסמכתא): a deputy director-general's circular of 25.8.80.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p10 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p11 Source (אסמכתא): the collective agreement of 15.5.89.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p12 Source (אסמכתא): a Director-General's circular.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_9__ssec_3_9_4/p13 Source (אסמכתא): a circular of the conditions-of-service department.

-- Examples. 1000 is a placeholder for the yearly amount, which the text
-- leaves to the update rule; nothing here is from a payslip.
`a PE teacher on one and a half positions` MEANS
    `PE clothing year` WITH
        `teaches physical education`      IS TRUE
        `meets the criteria of the table` IS TRUE
        `position fraction`               IS 1.5
        `allowance for one position`      IS 1000

#ASSERT `additional clothing allowance` `a PE teacher on one and a half positions` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `this year's allowance for one position` 1000 0.05 EQUALS 1050

#TRACE `payment of the additional clothing allowance in June` `a PE teacher on one and a half positions` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the additional clothing allowance` 1000 AT 10

§§ `Property checks`

-- The section's rules over their whole finite space: a teacher of physical
-- education or not, meeting the table's criteria or not, on 0 to 2
-- positions by quarters, with a one-position allowance of 1000 (a
-- placeholder); and update rates of 0% to 10%.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`the positions checked` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 4) (range 0 8)

GIVEN pe IS A BOOLEAN, crit IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `PE clothing year`
DECIDE `a checked PE clothing year` pe crit f IS
    `PE clothing year` WITH
        `teaches physical education`      IS pe
        `meets the criteria of the table` IS crit
        `position fraction`               IS f
        `allowance for one position`      IS 1000

GIVEN prop IS A FUNCTION FROM `PE clothing year` TO BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `holds for every PE clothing year` prop IF
    all (GIVEN pe YIELD
            all (GIVEN crit YIELD
                    all (GIVEN f YIELD prop (`a checked PE clothing year` pe crit f))
                        `the positions checked`)
                `both booleans`)
        `both booleans`

-- 1 and the table: nothing to one who does not teach physical education
-- or does not meet the criteria; and note (a): never less than nothing,
-- never more than one position's allowance.
GIVEN y IS A `PE clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the allowance is within one position` y IF
        `additional clothing allowance` y AT LEAST 0
    AND `additional clothing allowance` y AT MOST y's `allowance for one position`
    AND (`paid the additional clothing allowance` y OR `additional clothing allowance` y EQUALS 0)
    AND `paid the additional clothing allowance` y
        EQUALS (y's `teaches physical education` AND y's `meets the criteria of the table`)
#ASSERT `holds for every PE clothing year` `the allowance is within one position`

-- Note (a), as read: a larger position never pays less, and every position
-- of one or more pays exactly one position's allowance.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD
                    `additional clothing allowance` (`a checked PE clothing year` TRUE TRUE (f PLUS 0.25))
                    AT LEAST `additional clothing allowance` (`a checked PE clothing year` TRUE TRUE f)
                AND ((f LESS THAN 1)
                     OR `additional clothing allowance` (`a checked PE clothing year` TRUE TRUE f) EQUALS 1000))
            `the positions checked`

-- Note (b): an update at a rate of 0% leaves the allowance as it was, and
-- a higher rate never gives less.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                    `this year's allowance for one position` 1000 (r DIVIDED BY 100) AT LEAST 1000
                AND `this year's allowance for one position` 1000 ((r PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 100)
                    GREATER THAN `this year's allowance for one position` 1000 (r DIVIDED BY 100))
            (range 0 10)
#ASSERT `this year's allowance for one position` 1000 0 EQUALS 1000

-- 2: June, the month of payment, is the tenth month of the school year.
#ASSERT `month number` June EQUALS 10
